WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Choose large, light, easy-fit pieces.
Keep them close on a non-slip surface.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Touch or slide a piece toward a matching edge.
The diagram shows alignment, not a fastener.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Rest. Join physical pieces only if they fit easily.
Do not force tight connectors.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Example replay: align the edges.
A larger piece or stabilising help may assist.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Use no sharp pieces or strong magnets.
Avoid small parts when swallowing is a risk.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Final replay: keep the movement comfortable.
Open-hand sliding is a valid alternative.

00:36.000 --> 00:42.000
Leave the pieces together, or ask for help.
Record the adaptation that worked for you.
